# Force LF line endings on checkout, regardless of git autocrlf settings.
#
# The engine reads frontmatter and section headers via regex that work cleanly
# on LF. CRLF survives the major regex patterns but blew up parseFrontmatter's
# kv pattern (`.` does not match `\r`, `$` does not tolerate `\r`). Locking
# checkout to LF eliminates that class of bug entirely. parseFrontmatter also
# normalizes CRLF internally as belt-and-suspenders.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files (none today, but reserved).
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
